The '''ursine chainmace''' is an upgraded variant of [[Viggora's chainmace]], requiring level 70 in [[Attack]] to wield. It is created by combining [[Viggora's chainmace]] with the [[claws of Callisto]]. This process requires level 85 [[Smithing]]; players without the required level to combine the items may ask [[Andros Mai]] in [[Ferox Enclave]] to do so instead, for a fee of {{NoCoins|500000|c}}. This item counts as a [[Zamorak]]ian item in the [[God Wars Dungeon]].

